// compares its `.copy()` (SL:borrowing §2.2; SL-899)
// message: `v.find(0)` lends a place only when one is present, so reading it whole copies it out as an Optional, and `borrows.optional-place-read.Bag` is ExplicitCopy, which does not copy silently: compare `v.find(0).copy()`, or name the place: `if let x = v.find(0) { … }`

struct Bag { items: Vector<Int> }
